  "description": "SUNSET is a 35m (116ft) Sunseeker, built 2019, based on Australia's East Coast. She accommodates 10–12 guests overnight across five staterooms (Master, two VIP, two twin) and up to 33 for day charters, with five professional crew. Cruising grounds span the Gold Coast, Tangalooma, the Whitsundays and Cairns. Extensive toy package includes jet skis, seabob, JetSurf, paddleboards and sun deck jacuzzi.\n\n\n",
